(label "Y3" (at 62.23 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e45be8ab-65fd-5474-bd33-e31ce2cc6b14"))
(text "Replaces U201 on the rack sheet: the wires that went to the PLC's X0–X7, Y0–Y3, 24V and 0V land on X301.\nInputs: opto IN1–IN8 take the +24 V switch signals with COM to 0V; the opto outputs pull the GPIOs low\nwhen an input is on (use INPUT_PULLUP if the board has no pull-ups; check its jumper/polarity).\nOutputs: the D4184 modules sink like the PLC's NPN outputs, so lamps and the dock relay module (low-level\ntrigger) keep their +24V common wiring. GPIO16–19 drive the triggers (3.3 V logic).\nProposed pins avoid the ESP32 strapping pins 0, 2, 5, 12, 15 and the flash pins 6–11; GPIO34–39 are left\nfree (input-only, no pull-ups). The firmware exposes the same Modbus TCP map as the PLC (03 §4) over Wi-Fi.\nModule pin names vary by vendor: check the bought boards before wiring." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a7b3daf-3a51-5373-a32c-77b40b6e82fd"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
